{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13413","headline":"五老峰大明观赠隐者 · 姚系","name":"五老峰大明观赠隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云观此山北，与君携手稀。\n林端涉横水，洞口入斜晖。\n颇觉鸾鹤迩，忽爲烟雾飞。\n故人清和客，默会琴心微。\n丹术幸可授，青龙当未归。\n悠悠平生意，此日复相违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}